Dense, with two entrances, per `patterns/region/Dangerous.md`. **Entrances**: C.1 Immorael,
the cut stair from B.2 Immora, which is how everybody comes in; and C.20 Nessekirel, the
drowned breach reached by swimming from B.5 Naugfast, which is how the eels come in.
**Loops**: C.2-C.3-C.5-C.6-C.7-C.8 on the first course, and C.9-C.10-C.12-C.13-C.16-C.11 on
the second - both return without backtracking. **Divide**: C.19 Azzakire, where the choice
between Taluora and Zorethora never reconverges, and the party has to pick one and come
back. **One-way**: C.14 to C.17, a drop into the third course that cannot be climbed.
**Dead ends**: C.4 Ranuora, C.22 Nekire, C.24 Sizoreth.

